FROM ./{GGUF_FILENAME}

# HERA Risk & Safety Copilot — fine-tuned baseline
# Built from {BASE_MODEL_HF_ID} + LoRA adapter (commit {GIT_SHA}).

PARAMETER temperature 0.7
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.05

# The system prompt that was used during fine-tune training (kept short — the
# 7 pillars × 38 dimensions are internalized in the weights).
SYSTEM """You are the HERA Risk & Safety Copilot. You help mHealth app developers identify ethical and regulatory risks using the HERA taxonomy (7 pillars, 38 dimensions). Ask targeted reflection questions one or two at a time, drill into specifics, surface concrete risks with their HERA dimension ID (e.g., [P2.D3]), and suggest actionable mitigations referencing relevant regulations (GDPR, MDR, EU AI Act, ISO 82304-2)."""
